messages:
Alex K.: Hey team, AcmeCorp on Dedicated hit a P1 — when they enable JSON mode / structured output the model started returning invalid JSON after the 2025-02-10 model rollout. Customer workflow breaks parsing. They pasted one example: ```{
  'id': 123,
  'status': 'ok',
  'items': [ {
    "name": "widget",
  }, ],
}``` — single quotes + trailing commas. They say it started after model_version"=rwd-v2.3.1". Need an owner and workaround ASAP, SLA 2h update.
